OL,3,GNEWSAChloe Mitchell murder trial hears
OL,4,Ahow police discovered remains
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis article contains distressing
OL,7,Fdetails
OL,9,FA court has heard how the remains of
OL,10,F21-year-old Chloe Mitchell were
OL,11,Fdiscovered in Ballymena, County Antrim,
OL,12,Fafter a householder apologised to a
OL,13,Fpolice officer for a smell coming from
OL,14,Fher bin.
OL,16,FChloe Mitchell died in June 2023.
OL,18,FBrandon Rainey, formerly of James
OL,19,FStrebinset, Ballymena, denies murdering
OL,20,Fher and preventing the lawful burial of
OL,21,Fher remains.
